{"id":"pu_blico","lemma":"público","pos":"noun","rank":735,"glosses":["public","audience"],"ipa":"/ˈpubliko/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"públicos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/73/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-p%C3%BAblico.wav","examples":[{"text":"No me gusta cantar en público.","en":"I don't like to sing in public.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/354845","words":[{"g":"no / not"},null,null,{"g":"to sing"},{"g":"in / on"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"like, thumbs up"]]},{"text":"El público lo sabe.","en":"The public knows that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301856","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"it / him"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"}]},{"text":"El público parecía aburrido.","en":"The audience looked bored.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/735820","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to seem, to see fit","l":"parecer"},{"g":"bored, fed up"}]},{"text":"El parque está abierto a todo el público.","en":"The park is open to everybody.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/553758","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"park"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"open, unlocked"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Él estaba acusado de despilfarrar fondos públicos.","en":"He was accused of squandering public funds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/704386","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"accused"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to squander"},{"g":"bottom","l":"fondo"},null]}]}